# A low tom, one node: a sine that drops from 157 Hz onto G2, 98 Hz, within
# 10% of it 45 ms in, held 25 ms and released over 320, with the tick of the
# stick on top. Measured: loudest at 100 Hz; 20 dB down at 131 ms, 40 at 238,
# over (60 dB down) at 345 ms; peak 1.0. The note is the first argument: a few
# notes apart, three of them are a set.
instrument low_tom {
  tom(G2, drop=45ms, hold=25ms, release=320ms, click=-30db) as t
  t > out
}
